  "content": "\n\n<h1>重力附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgravity-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/gravity-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權\"></a></p>\n<h2>📖 描述</h2>\n<p>專為劍類武器設計的<code>重力</code>附魔，會賦予目標短暫的漂浮效果。這能讓你將敵人浮空，從而更輕鬆地進行連續打擊。</p>\n<p>此附魔最高等級為 2 級，每提升一級都會延長效果的持續時間。</p>\n<p>該附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot gravity_enchantment:gravity</code></pre>\n<p>賦予附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s gravity_enchantment:gravity</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>undefined</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題</h2>\n<p>請前往 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題或錯誤。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>💌 捐贈</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 捐贈</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 捐贈</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>undefined</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器架設</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器往往是一個耗時、繁瑣且成本高昂的過程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需輕點幾下即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候技術支援與快速回應，確保你的遊戲體驗不受干擾！感興趣嗎？我們為你準備了專屬優惠方案！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</